There are five kind of files in this folder:
- BalanceIssues.csv: These files contain extra units that were needed for the corresponding model
- CompAssinments.csv: These files contain the compositions assigned to each trip in the optimal solution (e.g. first model run)
- Summary.txt: These files contain the solver report and a breakdown of the objective function values for the optimal solution
- UnitAssinment.csv: These files contain the units assigned to each composition in the optimal solution (e.g. second model run)
- UnitSummary.txt: These files contain total unit costs and a breakdown of the units as well as from which composition solution this unit solution has been created from
All files contain the model type and the creation date in their name